{"id":"637186","name":"酱卤牛肉","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/637186/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛肉","amount":"1500克"}],"sub":[{"name":"香料包","amount":"一个"},{"name":"桂皮","amount":"适量"},{"name":"八角","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香叶","amount":"适量"},{"name":"草果","amount":"适量"},{"name":"山楂片","amount":"适量"},{"name":"茴香","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"甜面酱","amount":"一勺"},{"name":"干辣椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"冰糖","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好3斤牛肉，清洗干净。","img":"images/637186/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切成4块。","img":"images/637186/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"用清水泡2个小时，再次清洗干净血水。","img":"images/637186/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"起锅，牛肉凉水下锅，加入姜片和葱段、料酒。","img":"images/637186/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"大火烧开后，转中小火，煮10分钟。","img":"images/637186/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"撇去浮沫。","img":"images/637186/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"煮好了。","img":"images/637186/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"捞出，用温水清洗干净后，放入电压力锅中。","img":"images/637186/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入一包调味香料。","img":"images/637186/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"一勺甜面酱，冰糖、姜片和其他所有的各种香料。","img":"images/637186/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"倒入一碗老抽酱油。","img":"images/637186/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加入煮牛肉的原汤。","img":"images/637186/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"没过牛肉。","img":"images/637186/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"加盐和山楂片，盖上锅盖，压35分钟左右。","img":"images/637186/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"好了，泡一个晚上，可以更加入味和上色。","img":"images/637186/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/637186/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/637186/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"切片食用。","img":"images/637186/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/637186/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/637186/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/637186/step_21.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\